{"ref":"BDB, שִׁטִּים","hw":"שִׁטִּים","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁטִּים</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> always <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשּׁ׳</span>; usually Σαττειν:<br><strong>1.</strong>  E. of Jordan, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:1\" href=\"/Joshua.2.1\">Jos 2:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 3:1\" href=\"/Joshua.3.1\">3:1</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Micah 6:5\" href=\"/Micah.6.5\">Mi 6:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 25:1\" href=\"/Numbers.25.1\">Nu 25:1</a> (P); = <span dir=\"rtl\">אָבֵל הַשּׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:49\" href=\"/Numbers.33.49\">33:49</a>; on exact site v. Buhl<sup>G 116</sup> Gray <a data-ref=\"Numbers 25:1\" href=\"/Numbers.25.1\">Nu 25:1</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">נַחַל הַשּׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joel 4:18\" href=\"/Joel.4.18\">Jo 4:18</a> (perhaps <em>Wady es-Sanṭ</em>, W. of Jerus., cf. We Buhl<sup>Geogr. 90</sup>, and views in Dr).","next":"BDB, שָׁטַח","prev":"BDB, שִׁטָּה"}